---@field resourceClaimTemplateName? string resourceClaimTemplateName is the name of a ResourceClaimTemplate object in the same namespace. This field is optional. If it is not specified, no resource claim template is used. If set, it must be a DNS subdomain.

---WorkloadPodGroupSchedulingConstraints defines leaf-level scheduling constraints, such as topology.
---@class kubernetes.batch.IoK8sApiSchedulingV1WorkloadPodGroupSchedulingConstraints
---@field topology? kubernetes.batch.IoK8sApiSchedulingV1WorkloadPodGroupSchedulingConstraintsTopologyList topology specifies desired topological placements for all pods within the pod group. If unset, no topology placement is requested.

